[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6171135807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124442#issuecomment-6171135807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124442","id":6171135807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb9QPPw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T14:49:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T14:50:22Z","body":"Simply calling `apply_scripts()` should do the trick too. The problem is that renamer uses Script resource for lookup, but the code is not synced with the state in the editor. The sync happens when the script is parsed, so you need to be faster than parse delay to trigger the crash.\r\n\r\nForcing code apply might resolve some other issues with renaming and script validation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6171135807/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6171721606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124442#issuecomment-6171721606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124442","id":6171721606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb9z_hg","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T15:18:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T15:18:03Z","body":"In my tests the crash also happens after the script is validated at `CodeTextEditor::idle` timeout, looks like the `Script` is not updated there. Maybe that's a bug?\r\n\r\nUsing `apply_scripts()` in `FindInFilesSearch` resolves this regardless, didn't think about that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6171721606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6171944608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124442#issuecomment-6171944608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124442","id":6171944608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb-BmoA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T15:29:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T15:29:02Z","body":"_Technically_ this solution can crash if you modify a script during search, but this requires a big enough project + the script has to be far in the file list, so it should be rare enough.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6171944608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6172596139","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124442#issuecomment-6172596139","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124442","id":6172596139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb-pXqw","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight"